Package: agentop
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: terminal dashboard for AI coding assistant sessions
 agentop reads session data from ~/.claude/projects/ and displays
 token usage, cost, and cache efficiency in a clean terminal dashboard.
 Supports Claude Code with duf-style grid layout, color-coded token
 composition bars, and anomaly detection for inefficient sessions.
